    "heading": "Ship Repair",
    "lineStart": 6885,
    "lineEnd": 6887
  },
  "section": "6.152",
  "rulesText": "Repairs to a damaged ship can be made while the vessel is berthed. Repairing 1 Hit Point of damage requires 1 day and costs 20 GP for materials and labor. If the repairs are made in a location where supplies and skilled labor are abundant, such as a city shipyard, the repair time and cost are halved."
}
